OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAActivist not guilty of inviting
OL,4,Asupport for Hamas
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Jewish activist has been cleared of
OL,7,Finviting support for Hamas on social
OL,8,Fmedia after the 7 October attacks.
OL,10,FTony Greenstein, 72, of Brighton, was
OL,11,Fcharged with one count of inviting
OL,12,Fsupport for a proscribed terrorist
OL,13,Forganisation relating to three posts he
OL,14,Fmade, following the Hamas-led attack on
OL,15,FIsrael in 2023.
OL,17,FGreenstein, whose father was an
OL,18,FOrthodox Jewish Rabbi, described Gaza
OL,19,Fas a "human prison" and told Kingston
OL,20,FCrown Court that while he believed the
OL,21,Fattack was "justified", he does not
OL,22,Fsupport Hamas.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
